[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.7 - Equipment Loss Hotfix![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 19, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Type:[/B][/COLOR] Critical player protection hotfix

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]🛡️ Critical Bug Fix[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.7 - Boss Item Pickup Prevention[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Players losing armor/equipment when killed by bosses during combat
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Zombie and Skeleton bosses picking up dropped player items
[*][B]PREVENTED:[/B] Equipment being lost forever after boss death
[*][B]SOLUTION:[/B] Bosses now cannot pick up ANY items
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#6600CC]💡 What This Means for Players[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]No More Lost Equipment:[/B][/COLOR]
When fighting Zombie Boss or Skeleton Boss:
[LIST]
[*]Your armor, weapons, and items are now SAFE
[*]If you die, your items drop normally on the ground
[*]You can recover them after respawning
[*]Bosses will NOT pick up or take your equipment
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]📦 Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.6.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.7.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start your server
[*]No config changes needed - fully backward compatible
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] v3.0.6 → v3.0.7 = No migration (fully compatible)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Minecraft:[/B][/COLOR] 1.21.1+ (Paper/Purpur recommended)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Java:[/B][/COLOR] 17+

 [URL='https://gitlab.com/softici/halloween/-/issues'] Bug Reports[/URL]
 
[I][COLOR=#666666]Keeping your server fair and Halloween fun! 🎃[/COLOR][/I]
